//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
! First Time Setup
//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

1. Add the Experience to your land
   About Land > Experiences > Allowed Experiences
   Click [Add] > search "SkSk" > select "🌸 SkSk 🌸"

   Image: https://www.genspark.ai/api/files/s/2RiubDWY

2. Rez the object on your land

3. Approve the Experience
   When you first interact, your viewer will ask
   for permission — click Allow.

   To verify: Me (or Avatar) > Experiences > Allowed
   Image: https://www.genspark.ai/api/files/s/No4AEtYa

   To allow manually:
   Me (or Avatar) > Experiences > Search "SkSk" > Allow
   Image: https://www.genspark.ai/api/files/s/StWX3hM5

4. Enable "Use Shared Environment"
   World > Environment > Use Shared Environment
   Personal environment overrides will block this tool.

Done! Open the settings notecard inside the object
to configure your EEP settings.
You can also drop EEP items from your inventory
directly into the object.

